# Foundry compendium packs are ClassicLevel/LevelDB stores. Several of their
# internal control files (CURRENT, LOG, LOG.old, MANIFEST-*) are small
# plain-text-looking files that git's line-ending heuristics can silently
# rewrite (LF -> CRLF) on checkout when core.autocrlf is enabled, which
# corrupts the store. Never let git touch bytes anywhere under packs/.
packs/** -text -diff
